{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Independent Unit Operator (<i>No Experience Required</i>)</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Are you a round peg in a square hole? <br>Are you a <u>good person?</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Y.AI Corp.</i> needs you!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are seeking Independent Experience Operators motivated by mystery, fear, and violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This virtual position offers an exciting opportunity to join the emerging field of <strong>human-machine interfaces</strong>.*<br><br>Over the course of 3-6 days, you will be trained in all aspects of operating a <strong>Contactless Emotional Distribution System</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Features:</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relatable <strong>phone-based interaction</strong> system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248170/extras/74e9f301196836effd7e3e5d67fe6e80.poster.avif?t=1758829804\" aria-label=\"You use a camera app on your phone and interact with a coffee machine via a QR code.\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248170/extras/74e9f301196836effd7e3e5d67fe6e80.webm?t=1758829804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248170/extras/74e9f301196836effd7e3e5d67fe6e80.mp4?t=1758829804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive, simulated interactions</strong> in an enriching environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248170/extras/a3670eabe3ee017f77ccfdaa64a4797b.poster.avif?t=1758829804\" aria-label=\"You enter a bathroom using your phone QR based HUD. You turn on the shower and the &quot;disposal&quot;. You then grab a toy from the hallway and throw it into the disposal.\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248170/extras/a3670eabe3ee017f77ccfdaa64a4797b.webm?t=1758829804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248170/extras/a3670eabe3ee017f77ccfdaa64a4797b.mp4?t=1758829804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>fully-expressive dialogue system</strong> that provides the illusion of free-will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248170/extras/8d0e6b28c9040d894f39ecbaec6545a0.poster.avif?t=1758829804\" aria-label=\"You are engaging in branching dialogue with someone who is telling you to take your medication.\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248170/extras/8d0e6b28c9040d894f39ecbaec6545a0.webm?t=1758829804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248170/extras/8d0e6b28c9040d894f39ecbaec6545a0.mp4?t=1758829804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Privileges:</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple opportunities for <strong>violence-based stress relief</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248170/extras/a006d4a14bbf7224581b5ed1a199a4c2.poster.avif?t=1758829804\" aria-label=\"You use a handgun to shoot at shadowy figures in a glowing, colorful room.\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248170/extras/a006d4a14bbf7224581b5ed1a199a4c2.webm?t=1758829804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248170/extras/a006d4a14bbf7224581b5ed1a199a4c2.mp4?t=1758829804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Performance-based promotional opportunities</strong> allow for varying experiences of finality and operational re-alignment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248170/extras/42969aab3509c04af655e76e15f3c602.poster.avif?t=1758829804\" aria-label=\"You are in your apartment, it is dark with a faint red light. You are looking at a door that suddenly disappears into error messages.\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248170/extras/42969aab3509c04af655e76e15f3c602.webm?t=1758829804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248170/extras/42969aab3509c04af655e76e15f3c602.mp4?t=1758829804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced placement possible</strong> for skilled operators in a non-disclosed field <br>(<i>Security Clearance Required</i>).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248170/extras/6293205888ac6aa26b8dd4887685aa11.poster.avif?t=1758829804\" aria-label=\"You are in a strange place that is very dark, throwing a light down a cliff made of stairs you reveal that goes down fairly far. The scene cuts to another dark scene of writhing creatures. You run away from them towards a glowing round doorway.\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248170/extras/6293205888ac6aa26b8dd4887685aa11.webm?t=1758829804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248170/extras/6293205888ac6aa26b8dd4887685aa11.mp4?t=1758829804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Minimum Qualifications:</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capable of rapid text-based information processing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open to experiences involving cognitive dissonance in a non-traditional environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Able to complete assigned tasks independently.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Preferred Qualifications:</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Motivated to solve problems and navigate systems without formal training or a clear directive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resilient to psychologically-demanding scenarios without clear resolutions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Possesses a natural inclination for cathartic, violence-based problem-solving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strong desire to generate Value.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morally flexible.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Important System Disclosures:</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Standard Break policy</strong> is in effect to maximize <strong>Operator Coherence</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Occasional <strong>Service Outages</strong> may result in minor system instability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During outages, compliance with <strong>Secur Protoco<u>l</u></strong> will ensure you have a safe and predictable experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any fear you experience as part of this simulated program is valid and real.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>How to Apply:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Y.AI</i></strong> is proud to announce a strategic distribution partnership with the <strong><i>Valve Corporation</i></strong>, to bring this immersive experience directly to your home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Disclaimers:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*Payment is required prior to engaging in this unique opportunity. Compensation for your participation cannot be provided in a traditional format, and will instead be delivered directly as Value.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2248170?t=1758829804","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2248170?t=1758829804","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248170/9b75acd5092cc70970793d745eb604ede64c8018/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758829804","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248170/9b75acd5092cc70970793d745eb604ede64c8018/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758829804","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains extreme violence and dismemberment."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Independent Unit Operator (<i>No Experience Required</i>)</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Are you a round peg in a square hole? <br>Are you a <u>good person?</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Y.AI Corp.</i> needs you!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are seeking Independent Experience Operators motivated by mystery, fear, and violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This virtual position offers an exciting opportun